<description>&lt;p&gt;Libya saw a covert operation that seized a Lockerbie bombing suspect on its territory, indicating continued security actions against international terrorism. Haftar’s son conducted diplomatic visits to Morocco and met Syria’s foreign minister in Libya, linking Libyan factions to regional actors. A massive migrant boat capsized off the African coast, killing more than 130 people, and mines in the Egypt-Sudan-Libya border triangle remain contested over gold control, reflecting heightened insecurity. The government warned of penalties for unauthorized protests, and the UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPQnB1QllQTWY3QTRWYUk3YXFRNWpyRkZWSnRjT0ZQUmhudFlVWW9ZWV9QQ0dJQXpLcnFiT0RkdHZZQ1h1bkZWUkljeTNaSDk4UENzSXo5YXVnbXRXcGxIRlFWVUJTX0lSQU52RzBTcDlUekNhaVZaSWtWSEdxYjltVG13S0V5ZW9XNHB0ZTRqb2tqRzl3bXdZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQd0RFYmVHcUtjMHhVbXVuMkE2ZENnclg2VTE2MWI4T3FlX0piLVJPLTlUNFVqNmM5a2VueUpGYy1Fa1Y3aE1rcHJwWXlXVHR2eU53ekJMQnNpUEZmY1RmcUkzYkp0X2R0OWlDTnBzQ2JVM0xKMVRzRHZuLXl5NGZuZng4U1VMOFowbU81b0s1QkJRc3pweFFna3V6ZUdpRk1UdnJxOFFOUHI0TmstTU4zd1ZBSTFjcGtwMDA5MFV6S2FRdHJjUkdpTU9B?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bol News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPaHpUMXpWMDBLX0dadndDTHd0UVpEZkRoLTdGempTWkRJalRKb2cwUlgwd0N4TDBxSzkzb2J5ZW15NjNKam9nTEVqUG5jSmlrRDh0QWhsRGVQNi1aM3lhUG12ZTFOMVd5eG5FSjhpMjF2MExQV1cxYkxsdVhGZndfRm1ySVlTNkZVR2Z6UUw1LXFmSEEyU3M5VlN6NXgtdWdqQzRMdWd6Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Libya Update News - Libya Update News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPSGNmbWZ4REptUjBjdy00VUVZeWE5ZkdjNHlEbkFoZGRncUliM2l0ZWxYWkE2UllUUW1HZk5NNVJ1aGc5Si0tVjJ5cmZlTXdjcDVKbkJjdW1CTmlYdDgwblF